<title>POLAND: ESPEBEPE TURNS TO LOSS IN FEBRUARY.</title>
<headline>ESPEBEPE TURNS TO LOSS IN FEBRUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results February</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.52 vs   0.05 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.74 vs   0.01 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.70 vs   0.32 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    7.47 vs   5.51</p>
<p>JANUARY-FEBRUARY</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.94 vs   0.13 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.94 vs   0.13 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 1.01 vs   1.06 profit</p>
<p> Sales		   14.09 vs  11.50</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Espebepe</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
